Package: mlbshowterminal
Title: MLB The Show 26 Investment Terminal
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Joey", "Viola", email = "[email protected]", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny app for quantitative analysis of MLB The Show 26 card markets.
    Provides block-bootstrap price forecasting with Newey-West HAC standard errors,
    walk-forward cross-validation with isotonic calibration, and OVR change prediction
    using real MLB Stats API data. Architecture allows server-side API calls without
    browser CORS limitations.
